5. RES multistep and beta scheduling
   Mathematical/API reference: Comfy-Org/ComfyUI
   Fixed reference commit: b1a247c9cf9dbfda4b2c0a0c1d50950667eeaa0c
   https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI
   Reference project license: GPL-3.0.
   moss_art/sampling.py independently expresses the deterministic RES
   recurrence and beta quantile grid in JAX/NumPy/SciPy; the ComfyUI runtime
   is not bundled or imported by production code.
   Papers: https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.02157 and
           https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.12173
   A CPU-only diagnostic executes selected functions from the user's local
   ComfyUI source files pinned by SHA256 to the stated upstream revision.
   Those files remain in place, read-only, with their own license.

